Soution:
Formula: A = P(1 + R/100)^T, and CI = A − P

Calculation:

A = 4800 × (1.08)³
(1.08)³ = 1.259712
A = 4800 × 1.259712 = Rs. 6046.62
CI = 6046.62 − 4800 = Rs. 1246.62

Year-by-year check:

Year 1: 4800 × 0.08 = 384, so amount = 5184
Year 2: 5184 × 0.08 = 414.72, so amount = 5598.72
Year 3: 5598.72 × 0.08 = 447.90, so amount = 6046.62

Total interest = 384 + 414.72 + 447.90 = 1246.62, which matches.

The correct option is Rs. 1246.62.
